      "snippet": "又坑压了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s19",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "全都坑压呢?"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s20",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "水面都上升了一些就停在中间了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s21",
